cript/"},{"c":"FROG 2026 Q1","e":"frog","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Shlomi Ben Haim","x":"At LEAP New York, we demonstrated GA-ready solutions to concrete customers' needs for a trusted infrastructure layer for software supply chain management in the AI era.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/jfrog-frog-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FROG 2026 Q1","e":"frog","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Shlomi Ben Haim","x":"One is the big AI labs that are building their own data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/jfrog-frog-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FROG 2026 Q1","e":"frog","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ed Grabscheid","x":"We were very confident with what is happening right now in the cloud, and that is what gave us the ability to raise our guide from 30%–32% to 33%–35%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/jfrog-frog-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FROG 2026 Q1","e":"frog","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Shlomi Ben Haim","x":"As AI makes human-to-technology interaction nearly costless, and soft cost itself increasingly commoditized, binaries become king.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/jfrog-frog-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FROG 2026 Q1","e":"frog","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Shlomi Ben Haim","x":"…around binary security and not source code—because this is a big confusion in the market; coding agents are now securing source code, replacing human beings—together with the moat around Artifactory, the system of record, in a multi-agent world, the open source on top of it, and including the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/jfrog-frog-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FROG 2026 Q2","e":"frog","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Shlomi Haim